35:["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-cream/80 md:text-lg","children":"Maitama is Abuja's diplomatic enclave — and The DEN by Da Golden Chimney is just minutes away. For guests visiting Maitama's embassies, NGOs and executive residences, our Wuse 2 boutique hotel offers a superior alternative to generic hotels in the Maitama area: elegant rooms, a celebrated restaurant, secure parking and premium conference facilities, all at honest prices."}]
